f the county&rsquo;s 4 grids January to February came in under 90% of normal in 40 of 75 years. In 2025 that pair came in at 31% of normal, and September to October came in at 55%. So far in 2026, January to February sits at 14% and February to March at 29%. All 4 grids had their driest year in 1976, with grid 28635 at 43% of normal.</p>"}
